<Site title="Do prediction markets resolve fairly? A 7,253-contract Polymarket backtest | ClearMarket" description="Do prediction markets resolve fairly? Across 7,253 Polymarket markets, contracts ClearMarket rated C were formally disputed at 19 times the rate of A- and B-rated contracts. A backtest of resolution-risk grading: which prediction-market contracts resolve cleanly, and which get disputed.">
